          </p>
          <p class="mt-3">
            These Terms give you a limited, personal, non-exclusive, non-transferable right to use Focus Pet
            for its intended purpose.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3">
            These Terms do not transfer ownership of Focus Pet or its intellectual property to you.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-text-primary">Account Suspension or Termination</h2>
          <p class="mt-2">
            We may suspend or terminate access to account-based or paid features if reasonably necessary
            because of:
          </p>
          <ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
            <li>fraud;</li>
            <li>abuse;</li>
            <li>unlawful activity;</li>
            <li>unauthorized access;</li>
            <li>attempts to bypass payment or entitlement systems;</li>
            <li>serious or repeated violations of these Terms;</li>
            <li>security risks to Focus Pet or other users.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Where reasonable and legally required, we may provide notice or an opportunity to resolve the
            issue.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3">You may stop using Focus Pet at any time.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Account-data deletion requests may be submitted as described in the Focus Pet Privacy Policy or by
            contacting <a href="mailto:help@tryfocuspet.com">help@tryfocuspet.com</a>.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-text-primary">Disclaimers</h2>
          <p class="mt-2">
            Focus Pet is provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis to the extent permitted by law.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3">We do not guarantee that Focus Pet will:</p>
          <ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
            <li>always be available;</li>
            <li>operate without bugs or interruptions;</li>
            <li>detect every application or website;</li>
            <li>successfully block or close every restricted application or website;</li>
            <li>prevent all distractions;</li>
            <li>preserve every unsaved change in third-party applications;</li>
            <li>work with every operating-system update or third-party application.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Focus Pet is a productivity tool and is not intended to provide medical, legal, financial,
            safety-critical, or emergency services.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Nothing in these Terms excludes warranties or rights that cannot legally be excluded under
            applicable consumer-protection law.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-text-primary">Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <p class="mt-2">
            To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, Focus Pet and its operators will not be liable
            for indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages arising from or related to
            your use of Focus Pet.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3">This may include losses resulting from:</p>
          <ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
            <li>loss of data;</li>
            <li>lost productivity;</li>
            <li>interruption of service;</li>
            <li>third-party software behavior;</li>
            <li>applications being closed through enforcement features you enabled;</li>
            <li>inability to access Focus Pet or Focus Pro;</li>
            <li>third-party service outages.</li>
