          </p>
          <p class="mt-3">Nothing in these Terms limits liability that cannot legally be limited or excluded.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-text-primary">Privacy</h2>
          <p class="mt-2">Your use of Focus Pet is also subject to the Focus Pet Privacy Policy.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">
            The Privacy Policy explains how Focus Pet processes information, including application and website
            detection, optional accounts, cloud backup, Supabase, and Stripe.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-text-primary">Children's Use</h2>
          <p class="mt-2">
            You may use Focus Pet only if you are legally permitted to enter into these Terms in your
            jurisdiction.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3">
            If applicable law requires a parent or guardian to consent to your use of Focus Pet, you may only
